<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-June'97 trade gap widens to SKK32.57bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-June'97 trade gap widens to SKK32.57bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's foreign trade deficit totalled 32.572 billion crowns ($933.5 million) in the first half, up from 26.975 billion crowns for the same 1996 period, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The trade deficit was 29.859 billion crowns for the first five months of 1997.  </p>
<p>SLOVAK FOREIGN TRADE  JAN-JUNE 97  JAN-MAY 97  JAN-JUNE 96</p>
<p>  Imports (in SKK bln)   177.328	149.117     154.562</p>
<p>  Exports		    144.757	119.257     127.586</p>
<p>  Balance		    -32.572	-29.859     -26.976</p>
<p>Note: SUSR rounded up the deficit figures in the table. All figures are preliminary and subject to revision.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
